1. Create a stored procedure for retrieving employee details with supervisor ID parameter:

```sql
CREATE PROCEDURE GetEmployeesBySupervisorID
@SupervisorID int
AS
BEGIN
    SELECT e.Name, e.City, e.Address, COUNT(dr.EmployeeID) as DirectReports
    FROM Employees e
    LEFT JOIN Employees dr ON e.SupervisorID = dr.ReportingTo
    WHERE e.SupervisorID = @SupervisorID
    GROUP BY e.Name, e.City, e.Address
END
```

